<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0E2340', padding: '70px 80px 60px' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 92, height: 5, background: '#00A9B5' }} /><Text style={{ fontSize: 48, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>以步骤为单位，让每一次判断都有依据</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#C8DCF2', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>把解题过程显式拆成可以引用、判断和训练的步骤，使模型的判断有明确对象。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#C8DCF2', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>训练数量是过程记录，不直接等同于掌握程度；无 AI 的新题、延迟保持与迁移，才是更硬的证据。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#C8DCF2', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>本次汇报呈现设计思路与已核对的技术结构，不提供准确率、教学效果或出题质量的实验结论。</Text><Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18 }}><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', borderTop: '3px solid #00A9B5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 18px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.1 }}>12</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#9CC2E8', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>份设计文档</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', borderTop: '3px solid #00A9B5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 18px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.1 }}>124</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#9CC2E8', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>页汇报</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', borderTop: '3px solid #00A9B5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 18px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.1 }}>4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#9CC2E8', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>类实现状态</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', borderTop: '3px solid #00A9B5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 18px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', 